                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It was a fun little mystery game. I especially love the fact that the game gives you the option to solve it in real time with a timer ticking down as it made everything feel more urgent. The mystery itself was simple and straight-forward but it was still fun to go through piecing everything together. It would have been better if the game was longer, as they could have fleshed out some parts of the story or the characters, or if characters gave more contradictory statements that you'll have to sift through and decipher.\n\nThe main character was a delight! I enjoyed her personality and it was refreshing.\n\nI personally didn't mind the voice-acting and the character art, as it grew on me! Espeically taking into account it's from nearly a decade ago.",
